#: en/project-planning/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise-dataset-deliverables.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "說明"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise1.adoc:13
msgid "Imagine you are about to assess a species, perhaps choose a species that you are familiar with.  Determine which of the listed Darwin Core terms might be more relevant than others in assessing the extinction risk of a species and what might be some of the data quality issues associated with those terms. Remember that information for a red list assessment can be observed, estimated, inferred, projected and suspected."
msgstr "請假設你即將對某個物種進行評估，不妨選擇一個你熟悉的物種。請確定下列中的達爾文核心（Darwin Core）專有名詞中，哪些專有名詞在評估物種滅絕風險時可能比其他專有名詞更具相關性，以及這些專有名詞可能涉及哪些資料品質問題。 請記住，紅皮書評估所需的資訊可以是「觀察所得」、「估算」、「推論」、「預測」或「推測」。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/exercise1.adoc:14
msgid "You may find other relevant https://dwc.tdwg.org/terms/[Darwin Core terms^] to add to your list beyond the ones provided on the exercise sheet."
msgstr "除了習題單上提供的項目之外，您或許還能找到其他相關的 https://dwc.tdwg.org/terms/[Darwin Core 專有名詞^]，並將其加入您的清單中。"

